// Copy to app/Signing.xcconfig on the release Mac (git-ignored, never committed) and put the
// BT Labs Team ID in it (developer.apple.com, Account, Membership details). The iOS project reads
// it (app/ios/Flutter/{Debug,Release}.xcconfig) and tools/build-apple.sh mac-release takes the
// team from it. The macOS project does not: its Xcode build is signed ad hoc and mac-release signs
// it again with Developer ID, so no Apple Development certificate is needed for macOS.
// Do not pick the team in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities tab instead: that writes it into
// project.pbxproj, and release builds refuse a checkout with local changes.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
